  "notes": [
    "Authored entries: 'per_letter' kinds are expanded x 'letters' by lab/0.4-skill-graph/check_graph.py; 'skills' are concrete nodes.",
    "Codes are ASCII and stable forever: deprecate with status 'deprecated', never rename. Letter suffixes use Unicode letter names (MEEM, BEH...).",
    "Prerequisite forms: 'CODE' (that node) | 'KIND@same' (this letter's node of KIND) | {\"any_of_kind\": KIND, \"min\": n} (at least n nodes of KIND mastered).",
    "Mastery rules are v0.1 placeholders; Phase 4 replaces the rule, not the status labels (not-started / learning / mastered) that views read.",
    "Order of 'letters' is the default introduction sequence; the scheduler pulls the child's name letters forward and never introduces a confusable pair back to back."
